{"version":"https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1","title":"单味治病 - 标签","description":"Hugo FixIt 作者，喜欢瞎折腾、造轮子、写东西，分享一些前端开发中的所见、所闻、所思。","home_page_url":"https://lruihao.cn/","language":"zh-CN","icon":"https://lruihao.cn/apple-touch-icon.png","favicon":"https://lruihao.cn/favicon.ico","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.png"}],"items":[{"title":"奇治法：论单味治病","date_published":"2026-06-12T10:10:52&#43;08:00","date_modified":"2026-06-12T10:13:52&#43;08:00","id":"https://lruihao.cn/posts/4-28-jizhifa/","url":"https://lruihao.cn/posts/4-28-jizhifa/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://gravatar.loli.net/avatar/89719985bb81a6f9d508808413f1b999?s=32&amp;d=mp"}],"tags":["奇治法","单味治病"],"summary":"本节为《石室秘录》“奇治法”部分（与前文奇病治法不同），专论单味药治病的独特法则。核心思想是：奇治者，可以一味而成功，不必更借重二味也。药专力宏，直捣病所，若杂以他药，反牵制其效。","content_html":"本节为《石室秘录》“奇治法”部分（与前文奇病治法不同），专论\u003cstrong\u003e单味药治病的独特法则\u003c/strong\u003e。核心思想是：\u003cstrong\u003e奇治者，可以一味而成功，不必更借重二味也。药专力宏，直捣病所，若杂以他药，反牵制其效\u003c/strong\u003e。"}]}